WEBVTT

1
00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:29.139
Turn. turn. There's the sign.

2
00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:31.645
Oh. my gosh.
I can't believe we're finally here.

3
00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:34.409
Oh. wait. I told Shane I'd text him
once we're almost there.

4
00:00:34.551 --> 00:00:36.246
Oh. Mitchie...

5
00:00:36.386 --> 00:00:38.479
- What?
- Nothing. nothing.

6
00:00:39.189 --> 00:00:40.713
Mom. obviously it's something.

7
00:00:40.857 --> 00:00:42.757
I mean. you and subtle
aren't very good friends.

8
00:00:44.094 --> 00:00:47.655
I know you and Shane talk all the time.
but. you know. it's...

9
00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:50.391
You actually haven't seen this boy
in almost a year.

10
00:00:50.533 --> 00:00:52.296
I just don't want you to be
too disappointed

11
00:00:52.435 --> 00:00:54.198
if he can't come to camp this summer.

12
00:00:54.337 --> 00:00:55.395
Mom.

13
00:00:55.538 --> 00:00:57.904
I want you to have fun
and focus on your music.

14
00:00:58.041 --> 00:01:00.908
Okay. first off.
this is gonna be the best summer ever.

15
00:01:01.044 --> 00:01:04.138
And second. nothing can make me
lose my focus.

16
00:01:04.681 --> 00:01:07.275
What is that?
Did somebody open another camp?

17
00:01:22.866 --> 00:01:25.699
Seriously. why would somebody
open up another camp across the lake?

18
00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:29.100
Oh. who knows. but I don't think
it's anything to worry about.

19
00:01:29.305 --> 00:01:32.274
- Aah! Caitlyn!
- Mitchie!

20
00:01:33.643 --> 00:01:35.008
Whew!

21
00:01:36.212 --> 00:01:37.839
- Hi!
- Caitlyn!

22
00:01:37.981 --> 00:01:39.778
- How are you?
- I'm great.

23
00:01:39.916 --> 00:01:41.611
- Let me take this for you.
- Thank you.

24
00:01:41.751 --> 00:01:44.219
I was so afraid that we weren't
gonna get here in time.

25
00:01:44.354 --> 00:01:47.050
- but doesn't look like many are here.
- You know what this means.

26
00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:49.886
Since we're the first ones here.
we totally get our choice of...

27
00:01:53.329 --> 00:01:54.489
...bunk.

28
00:02:00.503 --> 00:02:01.834
I bet you sounded fantastic.

29
00:02:02.572 --> 00:02:04.403
Yeah? Oh. my gosh.

30
00:02:05.141 --> 00:02:09.134
Well. I guess no one cares
about my life.

31
00:02:09.279 --> 00:02:12.544
What don't we know? I mean. you update
your status. like. every two seconds.

32
00:02:13.383 --> 00:02:15.112
Fine.

33
00:02:15.885 --> 00:02:19.753
- I have a question. and it's for Mitchie.
- For me?

34
00:02:20.723 --> 00:02:23.419
So. what's going on with you
and Shane?

35
00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:24.686
- Huh?
- Hm?

36
00:02:24.828 --> 00:02:27.228
- Nothing is going on.
- That's a total lie.

37
00:02:27.363 --> 00:02:29.729
You guys are obsessed.

38
00:02:29.866 --> 00:02:32.494
No. seriously. I don't know. I just...

39
00:02:32.635 --> 00:02:35.263
I feel like if we never get to spend
any time together.

40
00:02:35.405 --> 00:02:37.532
then nothing is ever gonna happen.

41
00:02:45.014 --> 00:02:47.244
Just one more crank and I think I got it.

42
00:02:48.585 --> 00:02:50.450
That's good.

43
00:02:50.587 --> 00:02:54.523
Can we please just wait for the tow truck?
Oliver tried and he couldn't get it.

44
00:02:55.859 --> 00:02:58.089
That's because Oliver's
not properly motivated.

45
00:02:58.228 --> 00:03:00.492
He's not trying to get to Camp Rock
before Mitchie.

46
00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:02.257
